+
+The [current rollout and rollback runbook](../docs/x-sharing-rollout-runbook.md) contains the exact migration order, privilege and gateway probes, owner-operated sign-in procedure, and evidence gates for `toiylcfpbryztcfjievv.supabase.co`. Live authorization and backend readiness remain pending; bundled public configuration is not deployment access.
